! \n\nCould you please do the voice for my character, X'ele Tia, from Final Fantasy XIV? \nHe has a strict and serious personality, and speaks slowly and calmly. Sometimes his voice gets quieter, or the end of a sentence fades out.\n\nPlease refer to the video in the attachment for the character's voice tone and speaking speed. Id prefer that!\n\n【セリフ】\n1.\t自己紹介：\n「シェレ・ティア。これが俺の名だ。\n仕事がある限り、俺は行く。たとえ、それがゴミ掃除でも……神殺しでもな。」（声が静かに沈む）\n\n2.\t自分について：\n「どこから来たかって？どこかだよ……そんなの関係ない。\n今、ここにいる。それで十分だ。」（声が硬くなる）\n「過去は過去だ。もう置いてきた。」\n\t\n3.\t戦闘開始：\n「さあ、さっさと終わらせよう。」\n\n4.\t仲間（サイオンズ）について：\n「あのヒューランのやつか？うるさいし、よく喋る。\nでも……悪くはない。全然な。\nただ、隠し事が多すぎる。まったく、面倒なやつだ……」（ぼそり）」\n\n5.\t独白：\n「俺を英雄だなんて思うなよ。\nたまたま通りすがりに、世界を救っただけだ。」\n\nThe lines were created using translation. Please feel free to correct any grammar, natural pronunciation, or other points of concern.\n\nIf the fee is insufficient for the number of lines, I would appreciate it if you could resend your request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Z8JxaBwQbbCmRQuNQ-4KdUcG8bvdakBM/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@seizi_kannagi/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1905372, "client_id": 1767402, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/a8794fb4-5a2a-4646-b000-34ddab0a28c7?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1781927009&Signature=Avi-9MhW2T1WwnBvZrzYgyQl9Q9VdBWOrBxyGekmLFqN7jOtfbuAbglJ3tGal7bbMV9KRcLbUOOsIoUp-phqN5Gv7gnYZxvjsfSyrwsYlA45NUfYCou5IWaxk2mjz1ZAlwZMi1YHIRuenKdrck~HRfWBFMjtFvdGvfmN3ZBuSjxaiqOPktPNtyCy2yXdA8fU0kpb8IY~UmsKk-BwO9s4oiOtW7nNQvqU4Xz1ItFGhyYlud~NXL9N0EqgbKmzUYnfdxRNJpG2xYjzhqn2TCvlbFXV81T2nVZEpdxpAv-zX9B0EjhdYTEe0vErDgmXQdv9VgxlFV0yqxToYfopqSdLAw__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1907062621431549952%2F92ofKZVZ.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccom